     "value": "May be a component of the multisynthetase complex (MSC), a large multi-subunit complex which contains at least eight different aminoacyl-tRNA synthetases plus three auxillary subunits AIMP1, AIMP2 and EEF1E1. Interacts with the MSC components EPRS1, AIMP1, AIMP2 and KARS1"
